旁 温暖不溜走\n\n[singer: female]\n（Verse 4）\n夜晚的窗前 月光如水流\n我们相拥而坐 分享喜怒哀愁\n生活的琐碎 偶尔有争斗\n但爱从未走远 一直在守候\n\n[singer: male, female]\n（Prechorus）\n我们在这大城 续写小爱\n像星辰在夜空 闪耀光彩\n彼此的陪伴 是最美的依赖\n爱是永恒的歌 不会停下来\n\n[singer: male, female]\n（Chorus）\n唱一首大城小爱 为你而存在\n就算世界再大 有你就不孤单\n手牵手向前走 不管路多长\n在这小小天地 书写爱的诗行\n爱是大城的光 小爱的芬芳\n等你我一起把未来慢慢丈量\n\n[singer: male, female]\n（Bridge）\n如果岁月会老去\n爱依然不会凋零\n在这大城的角落\n小爱是最美的风景\n让时光来见证\n我们的爱情永恒\n让时光来见证\n我们的爱情永恒\n\n[singer: male, female]\n（Chorus）\n唱一首大城小爱 为你而存在\n就算世界再大 有你就不孤单\n手牵手向前走 不管路多长\n在这小小天地 书写爱的诗行\n爱是大城的光 小爱的芬芳\n等你我一起把未来慢慢丈量\n\n[singer: male, female]\n（Outro）\n（轻声合唱）\n大城的小爱……\n在时光里流淌……\n在心底里珍藏……\n直到地老天荒……\n唱一首大城小爱……\n爱是大城小爱……\n（渐弱收尾）", 999, "fixed", 97, 207, "4", "zh", "C major"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 267, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 268, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 257, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}], "flags": {}, "id": 94, "type": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.11.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"duration": true, "seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeAceSte